## Application Entry Point (`main.py`)

```python
# FastAPI app factory pattern
def create_app() -> FastAPI:
    app = FastAPI(title=settings.APP_NAME, lifespan=lifespan, ...)

    # Middleware order (last-added = first-to-run on request):
    app.add_middleware(LoggingMiddleware)   # 1st to run
    app.add_middleware(AuthMiddleware)      # 2nd
    app.add_middleware(AuditLogMiddleware)  # 3rd

    # Routes
    draw_routes(app)                        # all routes from config/routes.py
    register_uploaded_files_routes(app)     # file upload endpoints

    return app

app = create_app()
```

**Health check:** `GET /health` — unauthenticated, no JWT required.  
**OpenAPI docs:** `/docs` and `/redoc` — only when `DEBUG=true`.

