## Route Registration — THE GOLDEN RULE

> **ALL routes are registered in `config/routes.py` only.**  
> Never add `@app.get(...)` decorators directly on controller methods or anywhere else.

```python
# config/routes.py pattern (simplified)
def draw_routes(app: FastAPI):
    app.include_router(jobs_router, prefix="/api/v1")
    app.include_router(applications_router, prefix="/api/v1")
    # ... every feature module registered here
```

Base path: `/api/v1/...`

