## Auth Flow

- **Login:** `POST /api/v1/auth/login` → returns `{ access_token, refresh_token }`
- **Tokens:** JWT signed with `JWT_SECRET_KEY`; access token short-lived, refresh token long-lived
- **Middleware:** `AuthMiddleware` validates `Bearer <token>` on every non-public route
- **Multi-tenancy:** Every model has `account_id`; all queries are scoped to the current account
- **Public routes (no auth):** `/health`, `/api/v1/public/jobs/:token/apply`, `/api/v1/public/esign/:token`

