## JSON Response Envelope

All API responses use this consistent shape:

```json
// Success
{ "success": true, "data": { ... }, "meta": { "total": 100, "page": 1 } }

// Error
{ "success": false, "error": "Human-readable message", "code": 422 }
```

`meta` is optional (used for paginated lists).

