## Domain Feature Modules

Each feature follows the pattern: `config/routes.py` → `app/controllers/<feature>/` → `app/services/<feature>/` → `app/models/<model>.py`

### Core Domains

| Domain | Key Models | Key Routes |
|--------|-----------|------------|
| **Auth** | `User`, `Account` | `POST /auth/login`, `POST /auth/refresh`, `GET /auth/me` |
| **Jobs** | `Job`, `JobVersion`, `JobAttachment` | `GET/POST /jobs`, `GET/PUT/DELETE /jobs/:id` |
| **Applications** | `Application`, `Candidate` | `GET/POST /applications`, `PUT /applications/:id/move` |
| **Pipeline** | `PipelineStage` | `GET/POST /jobs/:id/stages`, reorder stages |
| **Interviews** | `InterviewPlan`, `InterviewKit`, `InterviewAssignment`, `Scorecard` | `/jobs/:id/interview-plans`, `/assignments`, `/scorecards` |
| **E-Signatures** | `ESignTemplate`, `ESignStageRule`, `SigningRequest` | `/esign/templates`, `/esign/rules`, `/esign/requests` |
| **Referrals** | `ReferralProgram`, `ReferralBonus` | `/referrals`, `/referrals/leaderboard`, `GET /referrals/bonuses/export` |
| **Audit** | `AuditLog` | `GET /audit/logs`, `/audit/delivery-failures` |
| **Workspace** | `Organization`, `Department`, `Label`, `CustomAttributeDefinition` | `/organization`, `/departments`, `/labels`, `/custom-fields` |
| **Communication** | `CommunicationChannel` | `/channels`, `/channels/:id/test`, `/channels/:id/set-default` |

### Public (No Auth) Routes

- `GET /public/jobs/:token` — branded apply page data
- `POST /public/jobs/:token/apply` — submit application
- `GET /public/esign/:token` — load signing document
- `POST /public/esign/:token/sign` — capture signature
- `GET /public/esign/:token/download` — download signed PDF

