## Database & Migrations

```bash
# Create new migration
python manage.py generate migration <description>
# Edit: db/migrations/versions/YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_<description>.py

# Apply migrations
python manage.py db:migrate

# Other commands
python manage.py db:rollback [--step N] [--to <rev>]
python manage.py db:status
python manage.py db:seed
python manage.py db:reset   # downgrade all → migrate → seed
```

Config: `config/database.yml` (per-env). `APP_ENV` (default `development`) selects the section. `DATABASE_URL` env var overrides the yml.

