| `CELERY_WORKER_CONCURRENCY` | Number of concurrent workers |
| `FRONTEND_PUBLIC_URL` | SPA origin — used for OAuth return URLs and public signing links |
| `GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID` | Gmail OAuth integration |
| `GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET` | Gmail OAuth integration |
| `AUDIT_LOG_BUFFER_ENABLED` | `true` to buffer audit events in Redis |
| `AUDIT_LOG_BUFFER_FLUSH_INTERVAL` | Seconds between Beat flushes |
| `ESIGN_ARTIFACTS_DIR` | Directory for generated signed PDFs |

